<div class="rounded-lg border border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-950/40 p-4 text-sm leading-6 text-amber-100">
  <% if AdminUser.configured_super_admin_emails.include?(@invitation.email) %>
    <strong>Super Admin access:</strong> this email is listed in ADMIN_USERS and will also have super administrator access, including permission to invite and remove GigaAdmin administrators.
    This account can invite Plex users, grant or revoke library access, remove shares, and view playback history and IP addresses.
  <% else %>
    <strong>Plex sharing administration:</strong> can invite Plex users, grant or revoke library access, remove shares, and view playback history and IP addresses.
    This account cannot invite or remove GigaAdmin administrators.
  <% end %>
  Invite only someone you trust to manage sharing on your Plex server.
</div>
